       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1) WRC Sumgait
2) Started psychosocial and legal support in Sumgait &#x201c;safe space&#x201d;
3) Conducting 30 family counseling sessions through WRCs in each region (and/or online)
4) Mobile clinics support in 15 communities
5) The Assessment of gaps and challenges in assistance provision to GBV
6) Multi-stage program for economic empowerment of women from vulnerable groups/communities conducted across the regions. The activity covers direct support to Green SME&#x2019;s, business development trainings, in-kind contribution, vocational training, business advisory services and employment seeking assistance (including tutorial on the use of Employment Sub-System under the MLSPP).
7) Assessment gbv and community resilience: connections and challenges
